{% if isFramework("javascript") %}

To create a custom cell editor, implement the `ICellEditorComp` interface, which defines two mandatory methods:

-   `getGui()` - Return the DOM element of your editor,
-   `getValue()` - called by the grid to get the final value when editing is complete.

A commonly used optional method is `init()`

-   `init(params: ICellEditorParams)` - called when the editor is initialised

Full details of the [ICellEditorComp](#icelleditorcomp) and [ICellEditorParams](#icelleditorparams) interfaces are listed below under API Reference.

{% /if %}
